<HD3>Reverse Form No. 2 (U)
</HD3>
<HD1>Instructions
</HD1>
<P>1. Before being taken into use, the derricks rigged in Union Purchase shall be tested with a test load which shall exceed the Safe Working Load (SWL (U)) as follows:</P>
